WEBVTT

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:04.230
Maria-chan!

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.850
Don't go!  Maria-chan!

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.230
Please take care of my Papa and sister.

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:13.940
Maria-chan!

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:18.200
Stupid brat!  Take this!

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.800
That's amazing, Maria-chan!

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.600
Shine forth, Falcon Crystal!

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:45.350
Prepare yourself!

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:46.520
This ends now!

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:01.330
Did that surprise you, gentlemen?

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:04.240
I've always wanted to try this kind of introduction at least once.

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:05.330
Who are you talking to?

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:08.370
Ah, I wonder who I <i>am</i> talking to...?

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:09.420
Don't ask me.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:14.000
I'm sure you'd like to know to how it came to this, aren't you?

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:16.420
Allow me to rewind a little.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:18.510
Like I said, who are you talking to?

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:21.550
What's wrong?

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.720
I just got an idea about the party I'm hosting!

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:25.520
Really?

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:29.940
To entertain everyone, I'll host a party that no one else could pull off.

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:35.440
All right, just watch me!  I'll throw an amazing party and surprise everyone!

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:38.990
Is that... a party?

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:42.280
Great, that's just great!  I've always wanted to go!

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:46.250
That does sound like something you'd think of, Teppei-dono.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.330
I see.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.960
Eh?  We'll be spending the night?

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.330
W-Wait a minute!

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:52.670
S-Schedule...

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:56.260
I'll be invited as well, right?

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:06.890
There are so many people.

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:09.560
You're right.  I wonder what lies ahead.

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:12.230
Like I said, I'm coming back tomorrow!

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:13.690
I'll be fine!

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:16.570
Okay, testing.

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:18.360
Good morning, everyone.

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:21.990
I am Arima Teppei, the host of this party.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:29.410
Those of you gathering today will be lodging together at a hot spring.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.830
I'd like everyone to relax just like ordinary people do.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:33.670
Teppei-dono, I have a question.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.250
Yes, van Hossen-san.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:39.590
I have no objections, but why a hot spring?

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.630
Isn't it a little odd for a party?

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:45.010
That's...

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:46.430
"That's"?

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:52.060
I just felt like I should do something special.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:53.270
"Special"?

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.190
That is correct.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:56.360
Ah, no!

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.190
This won't fit!

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:00.650
I-In a place like this...

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:01.450
H...

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:02.610
How...

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:04.570
How do you get past this?

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:07.030
How should we time our entry?

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:08.700
What are they doing?

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:12.410
I don't think either of them has used a ticket gate before.

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.210
Celebrities...

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:24.470
Oh!

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:25.340
Amazing!

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:29.930
I've traveled quite a bit, so this is no problem.

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:32.350
As expected of Seika-sama!

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:35.560
Your form as you passed through the ticket gate was beautiful!

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:38.320
If that girl is acting so high and mighty about a single pass,

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:41.440
then I should be the President for ordering a ticket book.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:45.660
Kaisuke?  The President is boarding the train at Kaisuke?

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:53.040
Seika-sama, riding on a train is so marvelous!

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:54.160
Seika-sama, let me take a photo of you.  Ah, wonderful!

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.830
You're pretty composed, aren't you, Charlotte-san?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.420
I had to help out quite a bit in my home country.

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.130
Because of that, I went on trips fairly often.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.300
Hmm?  That seems unexpectedly like a commoner.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:09.010
What Charl is saying is that she has often traveled across the continent as an emissary of the royal family.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.810
You traveled as an emissary of the royal family?

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:15.520
I'd bet those passenger tickets cost a fortune!

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.190
I'll have the beef.

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:18.110
Yes.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.860
If that's the case, does that mean you can't eat anything but onion ramen?

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:23.110
Why is it 'my ramen'?!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.650
It's not "Nezu", it's negi!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.650
Negi = spring onion.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:28.410
Hey, it's starting already?

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.910
I've still got a lot to say!

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.000
Who are you talking to?

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:36.000
<i>Who are you talking to?!</i>

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.790
This is the ladies' guest room.

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:07.680
Amazing!  It's Japanesque!

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.940
Yes, I'm a bit anxious...

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.260
Hmm... It's so-so.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:15.390
The gentlemen's room is this way.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.680
Hold it!

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.950
Yuu-san, why are you following me?

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:24.640
Eh?  My room hasn't been announced yet.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:26.870
It was decided just now.

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:29.970
That way...your room is that way.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:30.650
Eh?

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.290
T-That's...

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:35.720
Teppei-sama, I am just a maid.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:39.160
I should not be rooming with those from the Social Club.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:40.570
Come on, now.

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:46.350
Not bothering with that, and being able to have fun and get along with everyone

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:47.900
is what my party is all about.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:49.630
B-But...

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.340
Besides, I've only booked two rooms.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:54.800
We'd be staying in the same room in that case.

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:56.100
T-That's...

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.140
Understand now?

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:01.120
Besides, what your master says is absolute, right?

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.190
That's not fair, Teppei-sama.

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.710
Invoking your authority at a time like this...

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:06.300
I said it'll be fine.

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:11.060
And that's how it is.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.810
Like I said, who are you talking to?

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:16.380
I have finished my report.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.610
I swear, I don't get you sometimes...

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:22.870
Arima-sama.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:23.870
Arima-kun.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:24.960
Arima-kun.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.880
This is a wonderful party.

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:29.380
Yes.  Have my feelings reached you?

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:35.020
I have never dreamed of experiencing such a journey of discovery!

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:37.030
As expected of the Arima family heir.

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.090
Your heart is surprisingly kind!

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:44.660
Being able to socialize with others without rules and criticism

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.570
is what my party is all about.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.530
Riding on the bullet train,

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:51.420
eating locally prepared cuisine,

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:54.650
the hot spring that cleanses body and soul,

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:56.070
And...

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:57.360
..."that".

00:07:58.780 --> 00:07:59.410
Arima-sama.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:00.090
What is it?

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:03.660
Won't you feel a little awkward doing "that"?

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:07.800
I'll be fine.  That's why I asked for your assistance with "that".

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:09.080
"That" will be fine.

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:11.310
Oh, viva "that".

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:14.340
Still, Arima-kun.  "That" is a crime, is it not?

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:18.180
It's true that from the other side's point of view,

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:21.040
it would obviously seem to be a crime.

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:23.360
Among those staying here,

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:27.940
we definitely seem the most likely people to blame, don't we?

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:32.520
As I thought.  Perhaps making a move without understanding the other side is a bad idea?

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:34.770
It'll be fine.  Just leave it to me!

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.780
Ah, that means...

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:40.720
I am the "Lucky Pervert"!

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:44.340
These small details are nothing to me!

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:46.740
Noooo!

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:51.750
Ah, sorry, sorry.  I came in by accident.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:56.020
Sheesh Teppei, you pervert...

00:08:56.740 --> 00:09:00.460
What an incorrigible man...just this one time, okay?

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:04.670
Teppei-kun?  I guess there's no helping it, right?

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:06.590
Right!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:10.700
That's right...it was just an accident.

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:13.350
Sorry, everyone!

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.610
Truly, the "lucky pervert"!

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:21.110
Arima-sama!  Please share your fate and power with me!

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:25.330
I have no idea how to do that, but I'll try somehow!

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.700
Woohoo!

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:30.580
You shall use seventy percent and I shall use thirty percent.

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:32.920
No, that goes against my principles.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:33.630
It will be fifty-fifty.

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:37.190
Tonight, you and I will become the Double Lucky Perverts!

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:38.380
Nezu-kun, that's not fair!

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:41.350
Then, we'll all be Lucky Perverts!

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:43.640
All right!

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:47.570
An open-air bath!  Oriental style is wonderful!

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:50.230
If Teppei and the others peek, we'll beat them to death, okay?

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:51.680
It'll be certain death.

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:53.290
An explosive death.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:54.690
It'll be a slaughter.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.990
Do you always carry that with you?

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.070
Of course.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.220
Fujikura-san is so scared that she's hiding in the corner!

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:07.050
I thought that was because she was suddenly freed from the responsibilities of being a maid.

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:09.080
Yuu-san, come over here!

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:13.370
A hot spring, is it?

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:16.050
It's my first time visiting a hot spring with friends.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.020
Is that so?

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:20.550
I think you should leave that behind when you get in, though.

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:22.360
Why?

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:23.300
Why, you say...?

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:31.060
Is this really all right?

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:35.220
Today, it doesn't matter if you're nobility or royalty, or a maid.

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:37.270
We're just among girls, so let's get along!

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.610
Let's be very rude!

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:41.570
Don't you mean, "let's set aside rank"?

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.820
However, this sword is the pride of my country...

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:47.040
Do as you want, but it's still rather strange.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:47.570
You're like the Razoku.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.720
In the manga "Nihon no Razoku," a group of nudists attempt to take over Japan by force of arms.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.130
Razoku?

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:08.320
Amazing!

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:14.110
Seika-san, your hair looks much more natural when you let it down!

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:16.770
Doesn't it?  I don't really like it, though.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:19.130
Really?  I think it looks great!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.900
I feel the same.  I admire your dark hair.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:26.910
The obverse is also true.  Japanese people admire those with golden or silver hair.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.280
Both sides wish for too much, after all.

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:31.730
"Wish for too much," huh?

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:50.820
You have a nice, slender body!  Want to be a model?

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:52.100
Ah, can I?

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:55.190
That's mean, Erika!  Invite me too!

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:58.520
This is exclusively for those with tiny breasts!

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:02.220
That's awful, I won't forgive you...

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:05.690
Ah!  I'm sorry, Ayano!

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:10.060
Silvie, I've had such high hopes for you!

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:13.810
Is that so?  You too, Charl.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.700
You haven't changed a bit.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.650
What's wrong?  Why are you so tense?

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.490
Ah, but...

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:24.710
It's okay.  There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:27.520
Something like that.

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:29.690
You're a maniac.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:31.810
You've thought about this quite a bit, but listen up!

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:33.610
Reality lies beyond that wall.

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:36.330
Shall we enjoy their voices first?

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:37.980
This guy's a maniac, too...

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:42.810
Charl, aren't these a little too big?  They're three times bigger than I remember...

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:44.900
Noooo!  Don't!

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.000
Fujikura-san, you have good proportions!

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:51.690
N-No, I don't really...

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.410
Shall I touch them?

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:59.120
T-Those words...you're acting rather strange today...

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:04.460
I can't bear it anymore!  Let me go!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.210
Wait!  Don't rush in like that!

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:10.050
Th-That way is...!

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:19.300
His forehead reads "dumbass".

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:26.840
I guess this is it for me.  I leave the rest to you.

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:30.760
He could not become a lucky pervert.

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:32.180
Salute!

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:36.810
As I thought, bringing my sword along was the right decision.

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:39.540
Hmph, I bet this was their goal all along.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:43.520
It's okay, isn't it?  There's quite a bit of mist...

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:45.290
I wonder if the weather's getting worse?

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:48.670
It's supposed to be clear all day today.

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:50.630
Is it starting to get colder?

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:52.620
That could be true.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:56.430
Well, the weather in the mountains changes quickly.

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:05.390
We're taking a detour for the next operation.  Prepare yourselves.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.400
Captain, I have a question!

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:08.610
Sure, let's hear it.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:13.130
Yes!  Why are we wearing only one towel each?

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:16.050
Is this some sort of custom?  If so, it's certainly chilly!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:18.250
I'm also worried that it will be getting dark soon!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:22.400
This is a formal battle outfit!  If you get cold. hop in the bath!

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:23.630
This concludes the meeting!

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:24.120
Yes, sir!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.510
I also have a question!

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:27.610
All right, let's hear it!

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:33.570
Am I, who has suddenly become a main character whose name remains unknown, going to be a sacrifice this time?

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:36.260
That's right!  Gladly give up your body for us!

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:36.910
Yes sir!

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:43.810
Captain!

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:44.850
What's wrong?

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:48.020
My nipples are chafing, it hurts!

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:51.450
You imbecile!  If you say that, everyone will lose confidence!

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.130
Look.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.210
We're almost there.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:58.350
Huh?

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:04.620
Captain, the mist has gotten thicker!

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:09.080
You're right.  I  thought it was strange, too.  It's probably...

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:10.630
Probably...?

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.840
Your time is drawing near.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.890
I see...I thought that might be it...

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:22.470
Aaaah!

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:27.960
I guess I could only get this far.  I leave the rest to you.

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:30.270
Aaaah!

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:35.650
Nezu-kun...we can't let his sacrifice go to waste!  Let's go!

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.220
He had fallen.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:45.620
Aaaah!

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:48.830
By the time he turned around, Nezu had already fallen.

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:56.760
After relaying his distress to Teppei, he fell down and disappeared without even being able to scream.

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:02.680
That cowardly Nezu imparted something to Teppei.

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:07.480
Something that cried out within him, "Continue!  Go forth!"

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:12.820
"Even if you can't reach it, always face forward lest you fall into ruin."

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:17.820
Ah!  A shooting star!

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:19.800
Where is it, Charlotte-sama?

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.240
A shooting star, eh?

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:25.860
Want to try making a wish?

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:26.890
A wish?

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:30.720
They say if you recite your wish three times beneath a shooting star, it'll come true.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:32.960
Ah!  Another one!

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:45.100
How old are you guys, anyway?  You're not middle schoolers!

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:48.400
Seriously.  You were caught red-handed.

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:49.500
They stink.

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:50.310
Pigs.

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:54.980
Teppei-sama, if you would have asked, I would have shown you anytime...

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:58.930
Still, they're pretty daring, aren't they?

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.550
What do you mean, "daring"?

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:02.400
You boys will sit there until morning!

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:03.530
Eh?

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:05.120
Do you have any objections?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:05.670
No.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:10.500
Seika-san, since everyone's here, we shouldn't waste this opportunity.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:11.340
But...?

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:12.020
Okay?

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:17.000
Fine.  If you insist.

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:25.170
If you win this game, I, Houjouin Seika, the Social Club representative, will bow down before you.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:29.430
Still, Houjouin...I haven't done this sort of thing before.

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.770
Haven't you played tennis?

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:34.440
Hmm...I do remember playing that.

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:38.650
This is what they call...Table Tennis!

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:43.090
Arima-san, give us a good show!

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:45.130
Why are Teppei and Silvie playing?

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:46.910
Teppei may have more power,

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:52.160
but Silvia clearly possesses more technique and speed.

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:54.920
Say, is it all right if we play commoner's table tennis?

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:57.240
"Commoner's table tennis"?

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:01.200
I don't mind.  Regardless of how we play, my advantage won't change.

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:01.670
Very well.

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.300
Without further ado, we shall begin this match.

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:10.820
Ah!  Vincent-san!

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:13.770
Ah!  That's cheating!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:20.570
This is "commoner's table tennis".  If you find it unbearable, why not feint as well?

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:25.490
Very well, I'll go all out!

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.050
That's cheating!

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:29.280
What is?

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:32.410
No, it's nothing.  Shall we continue?

00:18:57.240 --> 00:19:02.400
I don't know why, but I have a sudden urge to embrace this guy in front of me...

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:06.910
It's so strange...

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:13.020
It's been longer than I can remember since I slept in the same room with another person.

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:14.330
Me too.

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:18.170
Since I've been in the orphanage, this seems fairly normal to me.

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:19.530
Is that so?

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:23.210
Although, it's been a while since I've gone to bed in such a fun atmosphere.

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:25.750
How was it?  Teppei's party, I mean.

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:27.970
This isn't a party at all.

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:30.800
Still, I enjoyed it.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:33.880
Then, Teppei-sama's club entry...?

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:38.650
I will formally make the official acceptance announcement next week.

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.530
I see you've already cracked, Houjouin.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:43.020
That...

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.150
...might be true.

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:47.940
This must be the influence of that pig.

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:51.660
It certainly seems that Seika-sama has changed a little.

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:56.660
Teppei's so mysterious, bringing us all together like this.

00:19:57.430 --> 00:20:04.340
Even though I don't want to admit it, I'm grateful to Arima for solving the issue that troubled me for so many years.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:11.100
He is Arima's splendid successor. He found many allies so quickly.

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:14.340
Even without words, we can understand each other through swordsmanship.

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:16.600
That kind of man doesn't come along very often.

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:20.230
Everyone likes Teppei.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:22.020
Even though he's a pervert.

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:25.530
It's not unusual for a boy of his age.

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:27.110
That reminds me,

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:29.700
earlier you said, "Just ask and I will show you..."

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:31.640
Do maids really go that far?

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:34.290
That's...I won't know until the time comes...

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:37.310
Silvie, are you going to marry Teppei?

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:38.610
I don't know.

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:40.780
Things are fine as they are.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:44.050
I wouldn't want to ruin our friendship over something so trivial.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:47.630
I see.  That's how it is.

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:51.390
We all like Teppei.

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:54.970
Teppei will eventually come to like someone.

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:58.980
That person might not even be one of us.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:04.480
Whoever Teppei chooses, no resentment or bearing grudges, okay?

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:08.610
That's the thing that Teppei-sama dislikes the most...

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:12.270
Perhaps he would prefer someone who acts ladylike?

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:15.800
By "ladylike", do you mean an older woman?  I don't think that's it...

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:18.330
Then, let's make a "Hot Spring Pact"!

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:21.310
"Hot Spring Pact"...that sounds interesting!

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:26.620
I'm going to bed, tomorrow will come quickly.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:27.750
You're right.

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:28.560
Good night!

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:29.860
Sleep well.

00:23:25.410 --> 00:23:28.040
Question!  What do you mean by, "woohoo"?

00:23:28.040 --> 00:23:30.690
"Woohoo", is it.  In an original work...

00:23:31.670 --> 00:23:33.130
Next time, on Princess Lover!

00:23:33.130 --> 00:23:34.650
Fiancée and Flower Petals.

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:37.040
In other words, the origin of "woohoo" is...
